  "clips": [
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P01_L001_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L001",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1 — верхний широкий кадр / шторм",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "После выхода из портала корабль Мики попал в страшный шторм.",
      "emotion": "напряжённое начало нового этапа",
      "emotion_tag": "[tense]",
      "duration_ms": 4240,
      "sha256": "f4581f748bd805622b11871c7ca7f57237b9045beacf1357a484ab15bbc7a022"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P01_L002_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L002",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "2 — кабина / тревога Мики",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Надеюсь, корабль выдержит!",
      "emotion": "волнение, надежда",
      "emotion_tag": "[worried]",
      "duration_ms": 2560,
      "sha256": "7b03bf36ebecc1cd8ecac146f321ea17a69130a437f6240b7ed926e9c999a7ac"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P01_L003_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L003",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "3 — корабль выходит из шторма",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Через некоторое время корабль выбрался из шторма.",
      "emotion": "облегчение после опасности",
      "emotion_tag": "[relieved]",
      "duration_ms": 3520,
      "sha256": "3c225e1088f02fc036796e7b03b1fbf1cad5334f0e73518224476e52ad797e05"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P01_L004_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L004",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "4 — Мика показывает на светящуюся точку",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Наверное, нам нужно туда.",
      "emotion": "сосредоточенность и любопытство",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 2560,
      "sha256": "686f83b32f0721a8b336292bcc2714fd6719227a7adc4ed7021a8037a9f4377b"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P01_L005_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L005",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "5 — светящаяся планета",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Приблизившись к точке, они увидели странную светящуюся планету. Она меняла форму и излучала огромное количество плазмы.",
      "emotion": "удивление, космическое открытие",
      "emotion_tag": "[awed]",
      "duration_ms": 8480,
      "sha256": "f40608f09620d5df0bee79781794f8589c0173bf8b2b8c8a803f0bfc6b9671fe"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH07_P01_L006_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L006",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "6 — сон и похожее существо",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Мика погрузился в сон. Там он встретил странное существо, удивительно похожее на него самого.",
      "emotion": "тихая тайна, начало сновидения",
      "emotion_tag": "[softly]",
      "duration_ms": 6800,
      "sha256": "f0979b358a4377cb3d5a8d4eb05e00ce691adecbbc51dd613fef3cb88148071f"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P01_L001_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L001",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1 — верхний широкий кадр / шторм",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "After leaving the portal, Mika’s ship was caught in a terrifying storm.",
      "emotion": "напряжённое начало нового этапа",
      "emotion_tag": "[tense]",
      "duration_ms": 4880,
      "sha256": "08a1f37edefcfd952e426e206422d307349ae30213318e77971c5ccb27a3bd73"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P01_L002_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L002",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "2 — кабина / тревога Мики",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "I hope the ship holds together!",
      "emotion": "волнение, надежда",
      "emotion_tag": "[worried]",
      "duration_ms": 2400,
      "sha256": "596c0cdc81b776918bc9a61ffc42953a7b47dcf749f1b89700498679211b55ae"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P01_L003_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L003",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "3 — корабль выходит из шторма",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "After a while, the ship finally escaped the storm.",
      "emotion": "облегчение после опасности",
      "emotion_tag": "[relieved]",
      "duration_ms": 3760,
      "sha256": "1ec7b5e32554ebf577c15767ecd77a67ad5307ecde6697d383f00272097122b3"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P01_L004_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L004",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "4 — Мика показывает на светящуюся точку",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "I think we need to go there.",
      "emotion": "сосредоточенность и любопытство",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 2080,
      "sha256": "e8607009508e43efcd2da6d5880f6a8c31776c3864e79e65b0e4edce6b11018d"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P01_L005_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L005",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "5 — светящаяся планета",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "As they approached, they saw a strange glowing planet that changed shape and released enormous amounts of plasma.",
      "emotion": "удивление, космическое открытие",
      "emotion_tag": "[awed]",
      "duration_ms": 8480,
      "sha256": "b23b0573133eae6590d43cc86f8250a45dc2628d3583e141b2dfb6c11ca6dbab"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH07_P01_L006_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L006",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "6 — сон и похожее существо",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika drifted off to sleep. In his dream, he met a strange being that looked remarkably like him.",
      "emotion": "тихая тайна, начало сновидения",
      "emotion_tag": "[softly]",
      "duration_ms": 6960,
      "sha256": "084d2bf053011ea829f976ce11a4d46bf0ed6bd4182d27fe19eb3600b95331ba"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P01_L001_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L001",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1 — верхний широкий кадр / шторм",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Ao sair do portal, a nave de Mika foi atingida por uma tempestade assustadora.",
      "emotion": "напряжённое начало нового этапа",
      "emotion_tag": "[tense]",
      "duration_ms": 5440,
      "sha256": "79b02f89f91ce425f5365b979d26896145b647b3caa8221aea12055a47e91e2a"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P01_L002_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L002",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "2 — кабина / тревога Мики",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Tomara que a nave aguente!",
      "emotion": "волнение, надежда",
      "emotion_tag": "[worried]",
      "duration_ms": 2160,
      "sha256": "18f1ca900f03dc2c6cd5e6dac620acaef357ff6c98662a97f9f5eac341602032"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P01_L003_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L003",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "3 — корабль выходит из шторма",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Depois de algum tempo, a nave conseguiu sair da tempestade.",
      "emotion": "облегчение после опасности",
      "emotion_tag": "[relieved]",
      "duration_ms": 4160,
      "sha256": "e8f332fad6bc59952b7968031a457b9146619ce35fa9c7410e97f6ab5a871bde"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P01_L004_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L004",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "4 — Мика показывает на светящуюся точку",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Acho que precisamos ir até lá.",
      "emotion": "сосредоточенность и любопытство",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 2400,
      "sha256": "d0a1f2de422c64261fd8b500a8857c6de132b7b05b42d5b2e34c36a36b5e79ef"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P01_L005_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L005",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "5 — светящаяся планета",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Ao se aproximarem, viram um planeta luminoso e estranho, que mudava de forma e liberava uma enorme quantidade de plasma.",
      "emotion": "удивление, космическое открытие",
      "emotion_tag": "[awed]",
      "duration_ms": 8160,
      "sha256": "80553d52e34785186c100d96738b8143ab483306b2fb0dabe275c2572b7ecdf5"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH07_P01_L006_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L006",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "6 — сон и похожее существо",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika adormeceu. Em seu sonho, encontrou um ser estranho que se parecia muito com ele.",
      "emotion": "тихая тайна, начало сновидения",
      "emotion_tag": "[softly]",
      "duration_ms": 6160,
      "sha256": "bb8e716ded4f4c554770446233ba2984b7ca315858fed3835d3e19460eb5fd7e"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P01_L001_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L001",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1 — верхний широкий кадр / шторм",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Al salir del portal, la nave de Mika quedó atrapada en una tormenta aterradora.",
      "emotion": "напряжённое начало нового этапа",
      "emotion_tag": "[tense]",
      "duration_ms": 5280,
      "sha256": "38756aacd352eb78bf881ee24951eb9156c1072e82200b0577956bd70e8b8d97"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P01_L002_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L002",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "2 — кабина / тревога Мики",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "¡Espero que la nave resista!",
      "emotion": "волнение, надежда",
      "emotion_tag": "[worried]",
      "duration_ms": 2160,
      "sha256": "6fd5c5d7ce5dc0bf84ce97f7cd28e55a0a24bdde0091d123b0d448a5b448c4e1"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P01_L003_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L003",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "3 — корабль выходит из шторма",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Al cabo de un rato, la nave logró salir de la tormenta.",
      "emotion": "облегчение после опасности",
      "emotion_tag": "[relieved]",
      "duration_ms": 3920,
      "sha256": "33c34b71fbd760b091ceae65d92af5a5d332f9a67b55909875f2a785660ab4aa"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P01_L004_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L004",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "4 — Мика показывает на светящуюся точку",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Creo que tenemos que ir allí.",
      "emotion": "сосредоточенность и любопытство",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 2320,
      "sha256": "5ddfe2f036ec29f16e1d7d7cc0d65fc4cf1823e5cd1aa8ae43fbcddace6fa37f"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P01_L005_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L005",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "5 — светящаяся планета",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Al acercarse, vieron un extraño planeta luminoso que cambiaba de forma y desprendía enormes cantidades de plasma.",
      "emotion": "удивление, космическое открытие",
      "emotion_tag": "[awed]",
      "duration_ms": 8080,
      "sha256": "01eb50ecf3b152ab638602a3f9b9db32f24addb3dc6ea8eecd47b8e4b2f06b9c"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH07_P01_L006_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L006",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "6 — сон и похожее существо",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika se quedó dormido. En sueños conoció a un ser extraño que se parecía muchísimo a él.",
      "emotion": "тихая тайна, начало сновидения",
      "emotion_tag": "[softly]",
      "duration_ms": 6240,
      "sha256": "c6e4ede21de1371d3655e5fbbf443d007eed7bddf2546262842f4b47292dec59"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P01_L001_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L001",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1 — верхний широкий кадр / шторм",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "À la sortie du portail, le vaisseau de Mika fut pris dans une terrible tempête.",
      "emotion": "напряжённое начало нового этапа",
      "emotion_tag": "[tense]",
      "duration_ms": 4800,
      "sha256": "6be4fbcb9ca7a2a952b610a642263ee3afa581b6e10a650cd99afc710f18cc92"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P01_L002_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L002",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "2 — кабина / тревога Мики",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Pourvu que le vaisseau résiste !",
      "emotion": "волнение, надежда",
      "emotion_tag": "[worried]",
      "duration_ms": 2320,
      "sha256": "abc5b82c3c1377d1d924de763af7501cf8c3aff9b5e87dd37097460864670e1b"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P01_L003_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L003",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "3 — корабль выходит из шторма",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Au bout d’un moment, le vaisseau sortit enfin de la tempête.",
      "emotion": "облегчение после опасности",
      "emotion_tag": "[relieved]",
      "duration_ms": 3680,
      "sha256": "da7f431a6bfd8bc0e1fc8260d3ee3873ea52510d237260cb12c5874e80b3e9e3"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P01_L004_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L004",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "4 — Мика показывает на светящуюся точку",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Je crois qu’il faut aller là-bas.",
      "emotion": "сосредоточенность и любопытство",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 2000,
      "sha256": "a10333d67120262222721cd958456e3a63c21cdf97ee3107177baf964b2640b1"
    },
