      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "5 — светящаяся планета",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "En s’approchant, ils découvrirent une étrange planète lumineuse qui changeait de forme et émettait d’immenses quantités de plasma.",
      "emotion": "удивление, космическое открытие",
      "emotion_tag": "[awed]",
      "duration_ms": 7760,
      "sha256": "3c72e070f4787765d77d8e806985cdec624334790613f61bd4e1ae403cb707de"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH07_P01_L006_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L006",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "6 — сон и похожее существо",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika s’endormit. Dans son rêve, il rencontra un être étrange qui lui ressemblait étonnamment.",
      "emotion": "тихая тайна, начало сновидения",
      "emotion_tag": "[softly]",
      "duration_ms": 6400,
      "sha256": "a18f94782c6e301293d033817061ba6b4d373b98a83fcdd1cbd7bbc398537ad9"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P01_L001_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L001",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "frame_id": "1 — верхний широкий кадр / шторм",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Kaum hatte Mikas Schiff das Portal verlassen, geriet es in einen gewaltigen Sturm.",
      "emotion": "напряжённое начало нового этапа",
      "emotion_tag": "[tense]",
      "duration_ms": 5200,
      "sha256": "b4910664fdb4cc58ecda1539346a831a8bc05777e6faed35c72a5cc14792cb52"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P01_L002_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L002",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "frame_id": "2 — кабина / тревога Мики",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Hoffentlich hält das Schiff durch!",
      "emotion": "волнение, надежда",
      "emotion_tag": "[worried]",
      "duration_ms": 2320,
      "sha256": "c90602bc5a5fa424b361c30a6f7d43ce190f0ce63f34d66da05b4bead04fa0a4"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P01_L003_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L003",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "frame_id": "3 — корабль выходит из шторма",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Nach einiger Zeit entkam das Schiff endlich dem Sturm.",
      "emotion": "облегчение после опасности",
      "emotion_tag": "[relieved]",
      "duration_ms": 3600,
      "sha256": "c20054ebbf3b31abdc442c6582fd1a6ebf21960a8c5c175e058d18d7a38623b3"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P01_L004_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L004",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "frame_id": "4 — Мика показывает на светящуюся точку",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Ich glaube, wir müssen dorthin.",
      "emotion": "сосредоточенность и любопытство",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 2560,
      "sha256": "7afd1e023e282031aa035cc9a6fa59fb6ea6bb9d33563cf29c2809e8d74bc49e"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P01_L005_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L005",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "frame_id": "5 — светящаяся планета",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Als sie näher kamen, sahen sie einen seltsam leuchtenden Planeten. Er veränderte seine Form und stieß riesige Mengen Plasma aus.",
      "emotion": "удивление, космическое открытие",
      "emotion_tag": "[awed]",
      "duration_ms": 8400,
      "sha256": "f7f64a6442804f42efb7aa43f3be6ec7729b25ec0d32f04f26d8ea7263f2936b"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH07_P01_L006_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH07_P01_L006",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "frame_id": "6 — сон и похожее существо",
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika schlief ein. Im Traum begegnete er einem seltsamen Wesen, das ihm verblüffend ähnlich sah.",
      "emotion": "тихая тайна, начало сновидения",
      "emotion_tag": "[softly]",
      "duration_ms": 6880,
      "sha256": "1ddc335ec13cb032b18887974afeba5c9e2856724c40661143384309929c74d4"
    }
  ],
